                                "sense_id": "cdaeb03f-8f81-3860-a2d1-26662845e132",
                                "text": "Sir Culling was an extreme Low Churchman, an Exeter Hallite to the backbone, and the head and front of the Platitudinarian Party."
                            }
                        ]
